{"product_id":"one-red-paperclip-how-a-small-piece-of-stationery-turned-into-a-great-big-adventure","title":"One Red Paperclip: How a Small Piece of Stationery Turned into a Great Big Adventure","description":"\u003cp\u003eKyle MacDonald wanted his own house and he didn't have money. He then remembered the game he loved to play - Bigger and Better. So he wrote an internet advert hoping to trade one red paperclip. Suddenly his inbox filled with responses. This work shows his various trades and how he met a lot of interesting people. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:134 x 214  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Kyle Macdonald \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780091914523 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 320\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44783325085849,"sku":"13RG9780091914523","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/4e48b6307ed2d9f2d2208e37418d9b13.jpg?v=1724768459","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/one-red-paperclip-how-a-small-piece-of-stationery-turned-into-a-great-big-adventure","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}